13
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:45,220
What should we do when he comes?

14
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:51,720
Otherwise, let's take a detour. Don't worry, it'll be fine.

15
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:53,990
Daqian pretty face

16
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:55,790
thank you in return

17
00:00:55,990 --> 00:00:58,990
Uncle, I decided to make it easier for you

18
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:02,230
Do you want to kneel down and thank me?
